</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Impact of Alzheimer’s disease risk factors and local neuromelanin content on the transcriptomic landscape of the human locus coeruleus</title>
      <link>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/preprint_lff_lc/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/preprint_lff_lc/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote class=&#34;bluesky-embed&#34; data-bluesky-uri=&#34;at://did:plc:vhtzwljkdzgy5fkuaqgitc6e/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4isvuqabm2v&#34; data-bluesky-cid=&#34;bafyreigdbmnlonsi3i5uyk2w5ycqvqhgixukoxtzaorwdqwm7wzb63dcvm&#34; data-bluesky-embed-color-mode=&#34;system&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;Got with the times + made a BSky to share our new, large-scale spatial RNAseq study of adult human #locuscoeruleus! Co-1st auth and cryostat wizard @heenadivecha.bsky.social squeezed 85 tissue sections into 43 Visium arrays. (1/8)
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1&lt;/a&gt;&amp;hellip;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:vhtzwljkdzgy5fkuaqgitc6e/post/3m4isvuqabm2v?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;[image or embed]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Bernie Mulvey (&lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:vhtzwljkdzgy5fkuaqgitc6e?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;@berniejmulvey.bsky.social&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:vhtzwljkdzgy5fkuaqgitc6e/post/3m4isvuqabm2v?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;October 31, 2025 at 11:42 AM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;script async src=&#34;https://embed.bsky.app/static/embed.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
