      <description>&lt;blockquote class=&#34;twitter-tweet&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34; dir=&#34;ltr&#34;&gt;Excited to share my first 🥇 first-author manuscript: &amp;quot;Data-driven Identification of Total RNA Expression Genes (TREGs) for Estimation of RNA Abundance in Heterogeneous Cell Types&amp;quot; 👩‍🔬 &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/LieberInstitute?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@LieberInstitute&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/scitwitter?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#scitwitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Now a &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/biorxivpreprint?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@biorxivpreprint&lt;/a&gt; ! 🎉&lt;br&gt;📰 &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/OJuAWndW51&#34;&gt;https://t.co/OJuAWndW51&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/VZ8xzJpcyv&#34;&gt;pic.twitter.com/VZ8xzJpcyv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; Louise Huuki-Myers (@lahuuki) &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/lahuuki/status/1521581339903873024?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;May 3, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src=&#34;https://platform.x.com/widgets.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&#34;twitter-tweet&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34; dir=&#34;ltr&#34;&gt;To end the week: CONGRATS &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/lahuuki?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@lahuuki&lt;/a&gt; for your first first-author &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/biorxivpreprint?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@biorxivpreprint&lt;/a&gt; 📜! 🎉 The first of many I&amp;#39;m 💯 sure!&lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/rstats?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#rstats&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/LieberInstitute?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@LieberInstitute&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;📦&lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/Bioconductor?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@Bioconductor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/5f79NtYyFu&#34;&gt;https://t.co/5f79NtYyFu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;💻&lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/github?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;@GitHub&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/Hpg8rKLsst&#34;&gt;https://t.co/Hpg8rKLsst&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;📔&lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/hashtag/pkgdown?src=hash&amp;amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;#pkgdown&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/6of1LCtxgC&#34;&gt;https://t.co/6of1LCtxgC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👀&lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/J0uJA15liE&#34;&gt;https://t.co/J0uJA15liE&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://t.co/uUPZEUXns9&#34;&gt;pic.twitter.com/uUPZEUXns9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; 🇲🇽 Leonardo Collado-Torres (@lcolladotor) &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/lcolladotor/status/1520220495869878272?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&#34;&gt;April 30, 2022&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;script async src=&#34;https://platform.x.com/widgets.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
</description>
